  "content": "\n\n<p>一款簡單卻極具效果的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/jicklus\" rel=\"nofollow\">JICKLUS</a>&nbsp;材質包附加模組！<br><br></p>\n<p>它會將五個模組（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterend\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better End</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betternether\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Nether</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bewitchment\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bewitchment</a> 以及 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mythicmetals\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mythic Metals</a>）的原版石塊材質，統一替換為 JICKLUS 的石塊材質，讓整體地貌呈現出更加自然的視覺感受！</p>",
